{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Light Noise 是一款主打零干擾的助眠白噪音工具，透過連續不斷的聲景協助使用者更快入睡，特別適合淺眠、容易被環境噪音吵醒，或需要穩定背景聲音放鬆的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-153.webp\">\n<h2>零廣告無間斷白噪音</h2>\n<p>Light Noise 提供連續不斷的白噪音聲景，完全沒有廣告干擾，播放期間音量不會突然下降，讓放鬆狀態保持穩定。內建高品質且經平衡的白噪音、粉紅噪音與棕色噪音，並具備無縫音訊循環，想聽多久就播多久。另設睡眠燈模式，方便睡前慢慢放鬆，適合需要安靜環境入睡或專注的人。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-272-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-273-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-274-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-275-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Light Noise | Sleep Sounds</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:38.679163+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T20:07:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:58:13.816248+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:14.570151+00:00","content_hash":"5362f736c959dd9a5052ecc913ee69fce8645d86defc59537e620b8a47a23d18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}